WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.907
For about 18 years I lived very close to
Băneasa Forest, and my son practically grew

2
00:00:10.957 --> 00:00:17.950
up here, from eight months
old until he was almost 18.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.677
It's a perfect place to
spend your childhood.

4
00:00:23.727 --> 00:00:31.950
There's a playground, there's
green space, it's a brilliant spot.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.793
At weekends we'd come for a picnic.

6
00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:40.884
I'd actually sit back and relax while
he played with the other kids, at the

7
00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:47.950
playground or in the park. He played football
too, right here in the park by Casa Albă.

8
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.388
I remember the restaurant before it was
renovated, with its old architecture.

9
00:00:56.438 --> 00:01:03.950
It was lovely then, more rustic;
the renovated version is lovely too.

10
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.495
Things change, but it's been a good
change for the people who live here.

11
00:01:10.545 --> 00:01:17.950
I like things the way they are; it would
be good if they at least stayed this way.

12
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:26.556
I mean, those with the power to change
things should look after nature.

13
00:01:26.606 --> 00:01:29.950
There's real potential here.

14
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.893
And you can see lots of
local people come here.

15
00:01:35.943 --> 00:01:46.513
They head into the forest along the paths,
especially behind the park, where there's

16
00:01:46.563 --> 00:01:51.950
information about the birds that live here.

17
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:59.363
You can learn a lot about
the vegetation in the area.

18
00:01:59.413 --> 00:02:11.950
Less so towards the zoo, but behind the park
I saw a place set up for research activities.

19
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:19.486
So you never get bored here.
There's a lot to see in this forest.

20
00:02:19.536 --> 00:02:29.109
And for a child in particular, who needs
to learn about nature, animals and plants,

21
00:02:29.159 --> 00:02:35.950
it's a place where they can
learn and explore a great deal.

22
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:44.266
It's peaceful, too. Move a little away
from where the kids are playing and it's

23
00:02:44.316 --> 00:02:49.318
deeply quiet. You can
gather your thoughts here.

24
00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:51.950
It really calms you down.

25
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:57.950
After a busy week, you can
really switch off here.

